  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ghana &#x2013; Coldstore for frozen food in the harbour of Tema</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With a guarantee of the DGGF to the investing bank Wegdam Food Link B.V. will be able to expand with a coldstore in GhanaThis Dutch trader in frozen food will provide an important Ghanaian buyer with additional cold storage capacity. The investment leads to a minimum of 65 new jobs and to improved food safety in Ghana. Because coldstores use a lot of energy, solar panels will be installed which will foresee in 55% of the total electricity use.</narrative>
  </description>
